{"id":"n82672-1-8","stage":5,"title":"티끌 · 尘埃","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82672-1-8-1","ko":"지수는 옷에 티끌 하나 묻어 있지 않더라.","zh":"智秀的衣服上连一点灰尘都没有呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}},{"text":"옷에","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷에","audio":"/audio/24872475f0018bd74d97.mp3"}},{"text":"티끌","meaning":"尘埃，灰尘，尘土","explanation":"티끌：尘埃，灰尘，尘土。","readings":[{"term":"티끌","audio":"/audio/5de80458023536003f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82672","senseId":"1","lemma":"티끌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"티끌","audio":"/audio/5de80458023536003f7c.mp3"}},{"text":"하나","meaning":"一、一个","explanation":"하나：一、一个。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}},{"text":"묻어","meaning":"沾上","explanation":"묻다：沾上；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"묻다","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46165","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묻어","audio":"/audio/0fa7fa947640dc2309b8.mp3"}},{"text":"있지","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfac